  non_TL_quadrants_input: contain ONLY the red anchor block (no other non-bg pixels)
  output_rule: |
    For each non-TL quadrant, scale the TL motif by (target_anchor_size / source_anchor_size)
    via nearest-neighbor resize. Reflect LR for right quadrants, UD for bottom quadrants,
    both for BR. Align scaled red region onto target anchor and stamp non-bg pixels.
    Skip divider row/col and existing red pixels. Clip at grid bounds.

generation_strategy:
